// # Autonomous Vehicle LiDAR Perception & HD Maps Unified Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 submodules across 3D point cloud filtering, ground segmentation, clustering, deep detection, tracking, fusion, odometry, and HD mapping.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API providing single-import access to the complete openOODA LiDAR Perception & HD Map stack.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular point cloud processing, neural detection, multi-object tracking, sensor fusion, and HD mapping submodules.
//   2. Re-export public perception pipeline configurations, factory constructors, and tracking shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA autonomous vehicle applications.
//   4. Expose high-level perception pipeline executive and runtime coordinator.

